# Raw Dataset

🔗 **Kaggle link:** https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/hisolanki/amazon-sql

## Why the raw data isn't in this repo

The original SQL dump is about 138 MB, which is too large to upload directly to GitHub — GitHub's web upload limit is 25 MB per file, and even splitting it into smaller parts wasn't a clean way to share a single usable database file. Instead of uploading fragmented or compressed pieces, I uploaded the full dataset to Kaggle, where it can be downloaded as one complete file.

To reproduce the analysis, download the dataset from the Kaggle link above, import it into MySQL, and then run the queries in `Analysis/Cleaned Data`.
